@startuml environment_interaction_enhanced
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 10

skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #F8F8F8
  BorderColor #333333
  BorderThickness 2
}

component [**Red Agent**\n$\pi^{(r)}$ fixed policy\nMITRE ATT&CK] as RedAgent #FFE6E6
component [**Environment E**\nHosts $N_t \in \{0,1\}^N$\nDecoys $D_t \in \{0,1\}^D$\nNetwork State $S_t$] as Environment #E6FFE6
component [**Blue Agent**\nPPO $\pi_\theta$\nAdaptive Defense] as BlueAgent #E6F3FF

RedAgent --> Environment : Attacks $a_t^{(r)}$
Environment --> BlueAgent : Observations $O_t$
BlueAgent --> Environment : Defense Actions $a_t^{(b)}$\n(Deploy/Remove Decoys)

component [**Detection Signals**\nReward Terms $R_t$\nShaping Signals] as Signals #F0F0F0

Environment --> Signals : Detection Events
Signals --> BlueAgent : Reward Feedback $R_t$

note bottom of Signals : Detection/Compromise Signals\n$R_t = \sum \alpha_i \cdot r_i(t)$\nFeed reward computation

@enduml
